<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador's coffee export prices detailed.</title>
<headline>Ecuador's coffee export prices detailed.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Here is a list of the minimum FOB reference prices for exporting 100-lb (45.36-kilo) sacks of Ecuadorean coffee, effective March 27-April 2:</p>
<p>	 Washed arabic....................$ 161.52</p>
<p>	 Natural arabic...................$ 153.65</p>
<p>	 Robust natural...................$  59.04</p>
<p>	 Roasted and/or ground............$ 126.55</p>
</text>
